sudo nano /etc/cups/cupsd.conf

Cambia Listen localhost:631 por: Listen *:631

En los bloques <Location/> y <Location /admin>, agrega la directiva Allow all:
<Location />
  Order allow,deny
  Allow all
</Location>

<Location /admin>
  Order allow,deny
  Allow all
</Location>

configurar selinux para abrir el puerto 631
sudo firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=631/tcp
sudo firewall-cmd --reload

